meta {
  name: Nearby Search
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/places?lat=37.7749&lng=-122.4194&accuracy=25
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  lat: 37.7749
  lng: -122.4194
  accuracy: 25
}

docs {
  Nearby places around San Francisco from the `places` table: the twenty
  nearest, then venues whose recorded grounds contain the point (each with
  `extent` and `distanceMeters: 0`), then large venues by category within
  2 km. `coverage` reports whether the area is loaded: `ready`, `importing`
  (with `estimatedSecondsRemaining`), `missing` or `failed`. Anonymous
  requests never trigger a fetch; send the bearer token to have an uncovered
  area fetched, and to see your private venues.

  `accuracy` is the phone's horizontal accuracy in meters; above 1000 the
  nearest-first search is skipped and only large venues are returned.
}
